e done.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,7444,0,0,26124),(29152,'I know very litte else... The High General chooses who may go and who must stay behind. There\'s nothing else... You must believe me!','I know very litte else... The High General chooses who may go and who must stay behind. There\'s nothing else... You must believe me!',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,7444,0,0,26124),(29153,'NO! PLEASE! There is one more thing that I forgot to mention... A courier comes soon... From Hearthglen. It...','NO! PLEASE! There is one more thing that I forgot to mention... A courier comes soon... From Hearthglen. It...',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,7444,0,0,26124),(29154,'%s dies from the torture.','%s dies from the torture.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,7444,0,0,26124),(29155,'You know nothing of pain, monster!','You know nothing of pain, monster!',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,7444,0,0,26124),(29156,'HAH! I\'ve survived three separate inquisitions! This is nothing in comparison!','HAH! I\'ve survived three separate inquisitions! This is nothing in comparison!',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,7444,0,0,26124),(29157,'Look out! There\'s a bee loose and it\'s on a stinging rampage!','Look out! There\'s a bee loose and it\'s on a stinging rampage!',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,7444,0,0,26124),(29158,'That one tickled...','That one tickled...',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,7444,0,0,26124),(29159,'I\'m going to send you back to the Lich King in pieces!','I\'m going to send you back to the Lich King in pieces!',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,7444,0,0,26124),(29160,'You\'ll be hanging in the gallows shortly, Scourge fiend!','You\'ll be hanging in the gallows shortly, Scourge fiend!',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,7444,0,0,26124),(29161,'I used to work for Grand Inquisitor Isillien! Your idea of pain is a normal mid-afternoon for me!','I used to work for Grand Inquisitor Isillien! Your idea of pain is a normal mid-afternoon for me!',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,7444,0,0,26124),(29162,'ARGH! You burned my last good tabard!','ARGH! You burned my last good tabard!',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,7444,0,0,26124),(29163,'LIES! The pain