rol. He is a monster that wants to see this world - our world - in ruin. Don\'t let him use you to accomplish his goals. You were once a hero and you can be again. Fight, damn you! Fight his control!',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,7464,0,0,26124),(29390,'There... There\'s no more time for me. I\'m done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they\'ll kill us both. $n... For the Horde! This world is worth saving.','There... There\'s no more time for me. I\'m done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they\'ll kill us both. $n... For the Horde! This world is worth saving.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,7464,0,0,26124),(29391,'Do it, $n! Put me out of my misery!','Do it, $n! Put me out of my misery!',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,7464,0,0,26124),(29392,'%s dies from his injuries.','%s dies from his injuries.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,7464,0,0,26124),(29393,'Come to finish the job, have you?','Come to finish the job, have you?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,7466,0,0,26124),(29394,'Ironic, isn\'t it? To be killed...','Ironic, isn\'t it? To be killed...',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,7466,0,0,26124),(29395,'$n?','$n?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,7466,0,0,26124),(29396,'$n, I\'d recognize that decay anywhere... What... What have they done to you, $n?','$n, I\'d recognize that decay anywhere... What... What have they done to you, $n?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,7466,0,0,26124),(29397,'You don\'t remember me? We were humans once - long, long ago - until Lordaeron fell to the Scourge. Your transformation to a Scourge zombie came shortly after my own. Not long after that, our minds were freed by the Dark Lady.','You don\'t remember me? We were humans once - long, long ago - until Lordaeron fell to the Scourge. Your transformation to an Scourge zombie came shortly after my own. Not long after that, our minds were freed by the Dark Lady.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,7466,0,0,26124),(29398,'A pact was made, $g brother:sister;! We vowed vengeance against the Lich King! For what he had done to us! We battled the Scourge as Forsaken, pushing them back into the Plaguelands and freeing Tirisifal! You and I were champions of the Forsaken!','A pact was made, $g brother:sister;! We vowed vengeance against the Lich King! For what he had done to us! We battled the Scourge as Forsaken, pushing them back into the Plaguelands and freeing Tirisifal! You and I were champions of the Forsaken!',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,7466,0,0,26124),(29399,'Listen to me, $n. You must fight against the Lich King\'s control. He is a monster that wants to see this world - our world - in ruin. Don\'t let him use you to accomplish his goals - AGAIN. You were once a hero and you can be again. Fight, damn you! Fight his control!','Listen to me, $n. You must fight against the Lich King\'s control. He is a monster that wants to see this world - our world - in ruin. Don\'t let him use you to accomplish his goals - AGAIN. You were once a hero and you can be again. Fight, damn you! Fight his control!',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,7466,0,0,26124),(29400,'There... There\'s no more time for me. I\'m done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they\'ll kill us both. $n... Remember Tirisfal! This world is worth saving!','There... There\'s no more time for me. I\'m done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or they\'ll kill us both. $n... Remember Tirisfal! This world is worth saving!',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,7466,0,0,26124),(29401,'Do it, $n! Put me out of my misery!','Do it, $n! Put me out of my misery!',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,7466,0,0,26124),(29402,'%s dies from his injuries.','%s dies from his injuries.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,7466,0,0,26124),(29403,'Come ta finish da job, mon?','Come ta finish the job, mon?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,7465,0,0,26124),(29404,'Dis troll gonna stand for da...','Dis troll gonna stand for da...',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,7465,0,0,26124),(29405,'$n? Mon?','$n? Mon?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,7465,0,0,26124),(29406,'$n, I\'d recognize dem tusks anywhere... What... What have dey done ta you, mon?','$n, I\'d recognize dem tusks anywhere... What... What have dey done ta you, mon?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,7465,0,0,26124),(29407,'You don\'t remember me, mon? Damn da Scourge! Dey gone ta drain you of everytin\' dat made ya a mojo masta. Every last ounce a good... Everytin\' dat made ya a troll hero, mon!','You don\'t remember me, mon? Damn da Scourge! Dey gone ta drain you of everytin\' dat made ya a mojo masta. Every last ounce a good... Everytin\' dat made ya a troll hero, mon!',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,7465,0,0,26124),(29408,'TINK, $n. Tink back, mon! We be Darkspear, mon! Bruddas and sistas! Remember when we fought da Zalazane and done took he head and freed da Echo Isles? MON! TINK! You was a champion of da Darkspear trolls!\n','TINK, $n. Tink back, mon! We be Darkspear, mon! Bruddas and sistas! Remember when we fought da Zalazane and done took he head and freed da Echo Isles? MON! TINK! You was a champion of da Darkspear trolls!',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,7465,0,0,26124),(29409,'Listen ta me, $g brudda:sista;. You must fight against da Lich King\'s control. He be a monster dat want ta see dis world - our world - be ruined. Don\'t let he use you ta accomplish he goals. You be a hero once and you be a hero again! Fight it, mon! Fight he control!','Listen ta me, $g brudda:sista;. You must fight against da Lich King\'s control. He be a monster dat want ta see dis world - our world - be ruined. Don\'t let he use you ta accomplish he goals. You be a hero once and you be a hero again! Fight it, mon! Fight he control!',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,7465,0,0,26124),(29410,'Der... Der\'s no more time for me. I be done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or dey\'ll kill us both. $n... Remember Sen\'jin Village, mon! Dis world be worth saving!','Der... Der\'s no more time for me. I be done for. Finish me off, $n. Do it or dey\'ll kill us both. $n... Remember Sen\'jin Village, mon! Dis world be worth saving!',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,7465,0,0,26124),(29411,'Do it, $n! Put me out a me misery!','Do it, $n! Put me out a me misery!',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,7465,0,0,26124),(29412,'%s dies from his injuries.','%s dies from his injuries.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,1,7465,0,0,2