3747,'It\'s time to wake up, magistrate! These aren\'t ordinary gnoll attacks!','It\'s time to wake up, magistrate! These aren\'t ordinary gnoll attacks!',0,0,0,0,0,0,25,7,1,10212,0,0,26124),(43748,'Where is the help that we requested from Stormwind?','Where is the help that we requested from Stormwind?',0,0,0,0,0,0,6,7,1,10212,0,0,26124),(43749,'What are we paying our taxes for if your guards can\'t even keep gnolls out?','What are we paying our taxes for if your guards can\'t even keep gnolls out?',0,0,0,0,0,0,1,7,1,10212,0,0,26124),(43750,'My children were kidnapped while they slept! I WANT ANSWERS, SOLOMON!','My children were kidnapped while they slept! I WANT ANSWERS, SOLOMON!',0,0,0,0,0,0,5,7,1,10212,0,0,26124),(43751,'You better do something quick or you\'ll have a riot on your hands, Solomon!','You better do something quick or you\'ll have a riot on your hands, Solomon!',0,0,0,0,0,0,5,7,1,10212,0,0,26124),(43752,'The gnolls have never been this aggressive. What\'s going on, Solomon? Tell us!','The gnolls have never been this aggressive. What\'s going on, Solomon? Tell us!',0,0,0,0,0,0,1,7,1,10212,0,0,26124),(43753,'How long must we stand here before our pleas are heard?','How long must we stand here before our pleas are heard?',0,0,0,0,0,0,6,7,1,10212,0,0,26124),(43754,'Get this damned line moving!','Get this damned line moving!',0,0,0,0,0,0,15,7,1,10212,0,0,26124),(43755,'You\'re good for nothing, Solomon!','You\'re good for nothing, Solomon!',0,0,0,0,0,0,14,7,1,10212,0,0,26124),(43756,'You can forget about re-election, magistrate!','You can forget about re-election, magistrate!',0,0,0,0,0,0,274,7,1,10212,0,0,26124),(43757,'No justice, no peace!','No justice, no peace!',0,0,0,0,0,0,15,7,1,10212,0,0,26124),(43758,'If you don\'t do something about these gnolls, we will!','If you don\'t do something about these gnolls, we will!',0,0,0,0,0,0,25,7,1,10212,0,0,26124),(43759,'Please help me! I\'m the last member of my family left. Everyone else has been kidnapped!