el, did you learn anything about the Goliath Cannon before your capture?','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80319,'','A bit. The one you destroyed was merely a prototype. The actual cannons are built in the foundry, to the north.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80320,'','I overheard one of the orcish leaders discussing a plan to use them on Shattrath.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80321,'Shattrath? Ha! Even that big ol\' hunk o\' metal couldn\'t hit Shattrath from here.','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80322,'They could if it was loaded onta\' a boat.','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80323,'I suspected the same thing. They must plan to load the cannons onto barges at the Naval Base, in the northeast.','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80324,'Our small group would never survive an attack on the Naval Base. Too fortified.','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80325,'We will continue attacking their supply lines.','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80326,'','D\'kaan, how long have you been scouting out here in Gorgrond?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80327,'A very long time. Longer than you\'ve been alive, probably by two or threefold.','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80328,'D\'ye get lonely?','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80329,'A rangari who is not lonely is not doing his job.','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80330,'Sounds like a crap job to me. Life ain\'t worth livin\' if y\'don\'t have lads and a lass t\'come home to.','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80331,'','Do you have a wife, Hansel?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80332,'Ach... the Blackrocks took \'er away.','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80333,'That\'s half o\'why I\'m here: ta look after Thaelin, and ta get me wife back.','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80334,'We will find your wife, Hansel. And we will leave a wake of bodies behind us. The orcs will pay with blood for what they did to our families.','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80335,'Y\'know, that\'s the darkest, coldest, most inspirin\' thing I\'ve ever heard from the lips of a paladin.','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80336,'Our work here is done. Next, we head to Smokebelcher Depot.','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80337,'Our work here is done. Next, we head to the Planteau.','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80338,'','Thaelin, are you doing alright in there?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80339,'Quite fine, ma\'am. Just happy to be out o\' combat and back in me Tank.','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80340,'','<sigh> This land is plagued by war. Do you think you\'ll return to the safety of home after our mission is done?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80341,'I dunno how much you\'ve heard about Azeroth, ma\'am, but we\'ve got our fair share of war, too.','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80342,'Once I\'ve found me Ellie, I know I\'ll be headed back ta Searin\' Gorge.','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80343,'What about you, lassie? Will ye go home?','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80344,'','With Velen gone, I feel like I don\'t have a home anymore.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80345,'We are draenei, Yrel. Being without a home is in our nature.','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80346,'','I was thinking I might go through the portal with you, my love.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80347,'Yes, Yrel. You will have a home on Azeroth.','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80348,'But first, we will make these orcs suffer for what they did to you. Their sins cannot be forgiven.','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80349,'','Maraad, you\'re frightening me.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80350,'The Iron Horde\'s supply lines are now cut, however temporarily. We have forged our alliance with the Shapers.','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80351,'There will never be a better time than this. Let us head to the Naval Base and exact our vengeance on the Iron Horde!','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80352,'','What is our plan, Maraad?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80353,'We will slay as many of the vile things as we can. We will burn their homes and show them fear.','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80354,'I will make them feel the pain I felt when I lost you, Yrel.','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80355,'','Maraad... I am honored...',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80356,'','...but perhaps you are taking your vengeance too far. Have you forgotten what the Prophet taught us?',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80357,'The prophet is DEAD, Yrel. Look what his teachings did for him.','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80358,'Ye\'ve gone too far, Maraad.','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80359,'The Light\'s left ye. Even I can see that.','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80360,'I carry no particular love for the Light, but I agree. You need to remember what you stand for, Vindicator.','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80361,'Are any of you more holy than me? I am the LEADER of this expedition, and I will not be questioned any further!','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80362,'The Light has not left me, Thaelin. No... the Light has finally shown me its true form.','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80363,'Vengeance.','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80364,'I saw the naaru\'s vengeance in the Purge of Grommar. I was there as K\'ara herself unleashed holy death upon the filthy hordes.','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80365,'[UNUSED]','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80366,'','Maraad, my love. That\'s enough.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80367,'Yrel...','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80368,'','You have been through too much, Maraad. Your thirst for vengeance will only lead to our death.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80369,'','[UNUSED]',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80370,'','Rest now. I will lead our attack on the Naval Base.',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80371,'I\'m with you, Yrel.','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80372,'I, too, will follow you.','',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,4,0,0,0,26124),(80373,'And 